window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b><i>EMILY</i></b><br> He’s the guy I’ve been crushing on since my sister married his brother.<br> Danil Koslov, the youngest Koslov brother.<br> And the sexiest, if you ask me.<br> We’ve been friends for a while now,<br> but something has shifted in our relationship.<br> Only thing is, I’m not sure if he feels the same way.<br> When I find out his brother ordered him to follow me to protect me from a stalker, I feel betrayed.<br> Is that the only reason he’s been getting closer to me,<br> To prove to something to his brothers?<br> I don’t know what to think anymore.<br> The only thing I do know is that these feelings aren’t going anywhere.</p> <p><b><i>DANIL</i></b><br> All I’ve ever wanted was the respect of my brothers.<br> When Dimitri offers me the chance to prove how valuable I can be,<br> I jump at the chance.<br> All I have to do is keep an eye on Emily,<br> I’ve had a crush on her for years.<br> I want to tell her how I feel,<br> but I’m afraid of ruining our friendship.<br> When we kiss, I feel sparks.<br> I’m sure she does too.<br> Then she finds out I’ve been keeping things from her.<br> She thinks I’ve betrayed her trust.<br> But I’m determined to keep her safe,<br> Even if she hates me for it.<br> The last thing I’m going to do is let someone hurt her.<br> <br> <i>Sinful Promise </i>is the sixth and final book of the <b>Kolslov Bratva </b>series. Each book in this series features a different couple and can be listened to as a standalone, but for better understanding of the world, you might want to read previous books first.</p>"; 
